### Variables d'environnement
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json


### Récupérer tous les utilisateurs
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### Créer un utilisateur valide (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin_user",
  "password": "securePassword123",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "birth_date": "1990-01-15",
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "iban": "FR7630001007941234567890185"
}

### Créer un utilisateur valide (USER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "regular_user",
  "password": "userPassword456",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Smith",
  "birth_date": "1985-06-20",
  "role": "USER",
  "iban": "FR7630001007941234567890186"
}

### Créer un utilisateur sans IBAN (optionnel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "user_no_iban",
  "password": "password789",
  "email": "noiban@example.com",
  "first_name": "Alice",
  "last_name": "Johnson",
  "birth_date": "1992-03-10",
  "role": "USER"
}


### Test avec username trop court (erreur de validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "a",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "first_name": "Test",
  "last_name": "User",
  "birth_date": "1990-01-01",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Test avec email invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "first_name": "Test",
  "last_name": "User",
  "birth_date": "1990-01-01",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Test avec date de naissance future (erreur de validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "future_user",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "future@example.com",
  "first_name": "Future",
  "last_name": "User",
  "birth_date": "2030-01-01",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Test avec IBAN invalide (trop court)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "iban_user",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "iban@example.com",
  "first_name": "Iban",
  "last_name": "User",
  "birth_date": "1990-01-01",
  "role": "USER",
  "iban": "FR123"
}

