}

### Test avec injection SQL potentielle
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "'; DROP TABLE users; --",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "sql@example.com",
  "first_name": "SQL",
  "last_name": "Injection",
  "birth_date": "1990-01-01",
  "role": "USER"
}